# R115's server line on top of the Flash-Next v3 preset (release/flash-next-v3/settings.env): R90's gains line
# (../../2026-11-11_r90_v4_vs_v3/run/r90.sh, GAINS_ENV and GAINS_ARGS, plus the draft's micro-batch of 512) with two
# changes: --ubatch-taper short=600:64 in place of on (R60, ../../2026-11-12_r60_taper_v4/) and no
# LLAMA_SAMPLING_TOP_K_ROWS=1 (FN84, ../../2026-11-12_fn84_graph_realloc/: it reallocates the prompt graph on every
# request). Both files run this line; the model file is the only difference.
LINE_ENV="GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL=1 GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL_MIN_RATIO=1.0 GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL_NSM=5 GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_DMT=1 GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_Q5K_MT=1 LLAMA_QSA_INDEXER_ROWS=1 LLAMA_QSA_KPOOL_DEV=1"
LINE_ARGS="--spec-draft-sampling probabilistic --spec-draft-p-min 0 --ctx-checkpoints-vram 4 --ctx-checkpoints-incall --ubatch-taper short=600:64 --spec-draft-n-ubatch 512"
